# Public newsletter form action (no secret API key).
# Buttondown (recommended): https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/YOUR_USERNAME
# Loops alternative:        https://app.loops.so/api/newsletter-form/YOUR_FORM_ID
# Set in Cloudflare Pages (or Vercel) env; required at BUILD time for static export.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BUTTONDOWN_FORM_ACTION=
